    "text": "Let W be as above.\n    a) Must the range of the function Tr(W (x, y)) for x, y ∈ GL(2, R) include the\ninterval [−2, +∞)?\n    b) For x, y being non-zero quaternions, must the range of the function Re(W (x, y))\ninclude the interval [−5/27, 1]?\n    (For some comments see ibid.)                                          J. Mycielski",
